	"nodes":[
		{"id":"51e85a6209bf20b4","x":-348,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"[[Unique Items.base]]\n[[Yormindar.canvas]]\n#Item "},
		{"id":"0c9e3e095d017531","x":-348,"y":-200,"width":771,"height":811,"type":"text","text":"Dark Silver is an ore found in places of extreme heat near the under dark. \n\nThe Currently on marked place with it is The Ember Hold below the residuum mines of Yormindar.\n\nDark Silver is a material that doesn’t not hold any arcane power but is incredibly conductive to it making it the perfect metal to use when forging magical artifacts. Some magical artifacts created using Dark Silver can go for upwards of 80k gold pieces depending on the item.\n\nDark silver Has the same metallic glint of silver but is a deeper color with a mix between the chrome of silver and the darkness of obsidian\n\nUsing Dark Silver you can create completely custom and unique items the more intricate the item the harder to create. Dark Silver can be used a catalyst to transfer one enchantment to another by temporarily holding the enchantment within it.\n\nTo copy an existing item that you have it takes about 8 hours of work.\n\nCreating an enchantment you are familiar with varies based off rarity.\n\nCommon-> 2 hours. \nUncommon-> 1 days avrg(8 hours).\nRare-> 1 week avrg(50 hours).\nVery Rare-> 1 Month avrg(200 hours).\nLegendary-> 1 year avrg(1000 hours).\n\nResiduum enchantment cuts the total time for each into a quarter of the total hours but is costly.\n\nCommon-> no enchantments \nUncommon-> 200gp.\nRare-> 600gp.\nVery Rare-> 4500gp.\nLegendary-> 50000gp\n"},
		{"id":"3c8c82401b29f52f","x":-348,"y":760,"width":468,"height":280,"type":"text","text":"Fashionable items.\n\nAny type of armor 3 Dark Silver ingots. \n\nLight weapons 1 Dark Silver ingot.\n\nLongswords and other adjacent items 2 Dark Silver ingots.\n\nGreat weapons 3 Dark Silver Ingots.\n\nEnchantable jewelry/Misc items range between 1 - 3 Dark Silver ingots At the dm's choosing. \n"},
		{"id":"26a2fff64d15403f","x":689,"y":466,"width":711,"height":334,"type":"text","text":"Dark Silver Disintegrator:\n\nCurrent owner Cassian Draemont, created using residuum and has a special enchantment from the arch fey Revilya.\n\nVery rare, (requires attunement)\n\nOnce per long rest you can cast the disintegrate spell from the palm of the Dark Silver Disintegrator. Additionally while attuned to this item as a reaction to taking magical damage you can absorb up to 50 points of the following types of damage fire, cold, acid, poison, lightening, thunder. The amount of damage absorbed resets on a long rest, however if the Disintegrator ever absorbs over 50 points of damage in one day it shuts down and requires an amount of residuum equal to 10 times the total absorbed damage to repair it.\n"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}